    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i looked it up online and a lot of people say muscle cramps are the main sign of low potassium. if i dont fix it, i'm just gonna keep feeling terrible. if i take 2 or 3 of those 99mg ones every morning, that's still like under 300mg a day, right? that seems like a really safe amount. surely my body can handle a little bit extra if it's actually helping the deficiency?",
